            0.147,
            0.82,
            0.591,
            0.84
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Then PT = 11 units and QT = 7 units. (Why?)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.846,
            0.902,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Using the Pythagoras Theorem to the right triangle PTQ, we get "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "PQ = \\sqrt{11^{2} + 7^{2}} = \\sqrt{170}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " units."
            }
          ]
        },
